sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports ISO15118-20
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS supports V2XChargingCtrlr.V2XSupportedOperationModes containing Idle
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CS supports SmartChargingCtrlr.SupportsFeature[EvseSleep] = true
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a

    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State ISO15118-20 transaction started in V2X AC_BPT energy transfer mode

    Note over CS,CSMS: Without EVSE sleeping
    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: trigger CSMS to set a TxProfile Charging Profile<br>with chargingSchedulePeriod with operationMode Idle and evseSleep false

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.operationMode must be Idle<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.evseSleep must be false<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.limit must be omitted<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.dischargingLimit must be omitted<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.setpoint must be omitted<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.setpointReactive must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = OperationModeChanged,<br>transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, transactionInfo.operationMode = Idle, evseSleep = false)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: With EVSE sleeping
    Note over CS,CSMS: Manual Action: trigger CSMS to set a TxProfile Charging Profile<br>with chargingSchedulePeriod with operationMode Idle and evseSleep true

    CSMS->>CS: SetChargingProfileRequest
    Note over CSMS: Validation: chargingProfile.chargingProfilePurpose must be TxProfile<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.operationMode must be Idle<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.evseSleep must be true<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.limit must be omitted<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.dischargingLimit must be omitted<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.setpoint must be omitted<br>chargingSchedulePeriod.setpointReactive must be omitted
    CS-->>CSMS: SetChargingProfileResponse

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = MeterValuePeriodic,<br>transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, transactionInfo.operationMode = Idle, evseSleep = true)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
